- content_for :title, "Submit Feedback - Baldrick Boards"

.max-w-4xl.mx-auto.px-4.sm:px-6.lg:px-8.py-8
  / Breadcrumb
  = render 'shared/breadcrumbs', breadcrumbs: [{ title: 'Home', path: '/' }, { title: 'Submit Feedback', path: nil }]

  / Main Content Card
  .bg-white.rounded-lg.shadow-lg.overflow-hidden
    / Header Section
    = render 'shared/page_header', title: 'Submit Your Feedback', subtitle: 'Share your testimonial or showcase your amazing display with the Baldrick community'

    / Content Section
    .px-8.py-8
      .max-w-2xl.mx-auto
        .prose.max-w-none
          p.text-lg.text-gray-700.mb-8
            | We love hearing from our customers! Whether you want to share a testimonial about your experience with Baldrick Boards or showcase an amazing display you've created, we'd love to hear from you.

          = form_with model: @feedback, url: feedback_path, local: true, multipart: true, class: "space-y-6" do |form|
            - if @feedback.errors.any?
              .bg-red-50.border.border-red-200.rounded-md.p-4.mb-6
                h3.text-sm.font-medium.text-red-800.mb-2
                  | Please correct the following errors:
                ul.text-sm.text-red-700.list-disc.list-inside
                  - @feedback.errors.full_messages.each do |message|
                    li = message

            .grid.md:grid-cols-2.gap-6
              .space-y-2
                = form.label :name, "Your Name", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
                = form.text_field :name, class: "w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500", placeholder: "Enter your full name"
              
              .space-y-2
                = form.label :email, "Email Address", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
                = form.email_field :email, class: "w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500", placeholder: "your.email@example.com"

            .space-y-2
              = form.label :feedback_type, "Type of Feedback", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
              = form.select :feedback_type, options_for_select([['Select feedback type...', ''],['Testimonial - Share your experience', 'testimonial'],['Showcase - Display your creation', 'showcase']], @feedback.feedback_type),{},{ class: "w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500" }

            .space-y-2
              = form.label :content, "Your Feedback", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
              = form.text_area :content, 
                  rows: 6,
                  class: "w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500",
                  placeholder: "Tell us about your experience with Baldrick Boards or describe your amazing display..."

            .space-y-2
              = form.label :image, "Image (Optional)", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
              = form.file_field :image, 
                  accept: "image/*",
                  class: "w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500"
              p.text-sm.text-gray-500
                | Upload an image of your display or setup (JPG, PNG, GIF - max 10MB)

            .bg-blue-50.border.border-blue-200.rounded-md.p-4
              h4.text-sm.font-medium.text-blue-800.mb-2 Important Notes:
              ul.text-sm.text-blue-700.list-disc.list-inside.space-y-1
                li We review all submissions before featuring them on our site
                li By submitting, you give us permission to use your feedback and images
                li We may edit submissions for clarity or length
                li You'll be credited for your testimonial or showcase

            .flex.justify-end.space-x-4
              = link_to "Cancel", :back, class: "px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-indigo-500"
              = form.submit "Submit Feedback", class: "px-6 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-indigo-500"
